"section",null,{"className":"card space-y-2 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold","children":"Duplicates & price statistics"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The same home may appear on several portals. Our engine flags likely duplicates using listing IDs, URLs, titles, geometry and price signals, but uncertain matches are never silently merged — every source record keeps its own price, area and original URL."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Locality price figures are ",["$","b",null,{"children":"asking prices from collected listings"}],", not registered transaction values or government guidance prices. Small samples are withheld rather than published as misleading averages."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"card space-y-2 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold","children":"Takedown requests"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Are you a portal, builder, agent or homeowner and want a listing removed or corrected? Email ",["$","a",null,{"className":"underline","href":"mailto:legal@localhost","children":["legal@","localhost"]}]," with the listing URL(s). We verify and remove within 7 days; removals are recorded in our audit trail."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-slate-500","children":["Scope: this release covers ",["$","b",null,{"children":"Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India only"}],". Listings from other cities are rejected at ingestion even if similarly named. See also ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/about/data-policy","className":"underline","children":"data retention policy"}],"."]}]]}]
